/11BT4FfD1Epg9Io8niDnhNFZbD8MoaWef/view?usp=sharing\n\n\"ミキオ \"は審判と同じ服装で、\"アンブラ \"はもう少しカジュアルな服装で https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cP5xu2IkEz2yZznDBmAD1jj4oUDCIULK/view?usp=sharing\n\nこのようなポーズでお願いします。https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ul6vJjd48ABcu-JM7AYXo9CkSaMp9Hed/view?usp=sharing\n\n「Umbraが左、Mikioが右。\n\n「Umbra」は「Mikio」のシャツをつかみますが、髪の毛はつかみません。\n\n二人の表情は、少しはにかんだような感じであること。\n\nお疲れ様でした。必要なら否定してください。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@zatta_akaa/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1413560, "client_id": 628702, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/06d2be06/uploads/origins/4855620d-aec3-495a-8216-9f114df99aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e41bf597078cb4d4fb2a089d0d6b58c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/06d2be06/uploads/origins/4855620d-aec3-495a-8216-9f114df99aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e41bf597078cb4d4fb2a089d0d6b58c, https://si.imgix.net/06d2be06/uploads/origins/4855620d-aec3-495a-8216-9f114df99aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67a8d6ab5bdc26d14bce62aa267489f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/06d2be06/uploads/origins/4855620d-aec3-495a-8216-9f114df99aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fd9caa34b747bc4cecfd259dd6db488 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/06d2be06/uploads/origins/4855620d-aec3-495a-8216-9f114df99aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2dec3060db09a39fce907709368112b1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/06d2be06/uploads/origins/4855620d-aec3-495a-8216-9f114df99aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2dec3060db09a39fce907709368112b